            <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="textBrowser_4">
             <property name="geometry">
              <rect>
               <x>230</x>
               <y>0</y>
               <width>801</width>
               <height>111</height>
              </rect>
             </property>
             <property name="font">
              <font>
               <pointsize>12</pointsize>
               <weight>75</weight>
               <bold>true</bold>
              </font>
             </property>
             <property name="styleSheet">
              <string notr="true">background-color: rgb(255, 170, 255);</string>
             </property>
             <property name="html">
              <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'PMingLiU'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt;1. 示波器抓取適配器DC頭插入樣機Jack 頭瞬間DC-DC芯片VIN電壓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt;2. 測試點：測量DC-DC芯片的VIN管腳輸入電壓。注意探頭位置為芯片最近輸入端,探頭地和信號之間的迴路最短，電感最小。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt;3. 覆蓋單板上所有DC-DC芯片，每顆芯片測試5次，記錄最大衝擊電壓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </widget>
          </widget>
